  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(20, 24, 35); text-transform: none; line-height: 19.32px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">El pasacalle infantil de disfraces de Fira d&#39;Onda, que ten&iacute;a que salir a las 11 desde la calle Cervantes,&nbsp;se aplaza al jueves a las 17 horas por la lluvia. </span><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(20, 24, 35); text-transform: none; line-height: 19.32px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">El concierto de la Onda Big Band con Melody de la noche de este lunes ser&aacute; en el interior del pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo a las 23 horas. </span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plujaajornacercavilainfantilfiraonda15/p1190348.jpg\" alt=\"p1190348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plujaajornacercavilainfantilfiraonda15/p1190349.jpg\" alt=\"p1190349\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plujaajornacercavilainfantilfiraonda15/p1190350.jpg\" alt=\"p1190350\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plujaajornacercavilainfantilfiraonda15/p1190351.jpg\" alt=\"p1190351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9